  "prefLabel": "Bea 602.03 Area median income (AMI)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 602.03 “Area median income (AMI)” means the median income of the greater region, either the HUD metropolitan or non-metropolitan fair market rent area to which the municipality belongs, as is established and updated annually by HUD.\n\nSource. #14044, eff 8-8-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bea600.html"
